1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,800
DMOS 1.2 “Maré” is out, and ready to download.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:13,100
What's new in 1.2: DMOS IA, a search assistant in the dock; a colour and wallpaper picker; a full-screen application launcher with Super + A; and English text in English sessions.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,900
New: DMOS IA. Ask in your own words. It is a new app in the dock, and the DMOS Hub panel also gained an “Ask the AI…” field.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:29,200
The answer comes with its sources, numbered and one click away. It is answered by Claude, from Anthropic, which searches the web. In this screenshot the answer comes from a test server.

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:38,500
Frankly: the key is yours. Everyone uses their own Anthropic API key, paid per use. The ISO ships with no key, and without a key nothing is sent. The key stays on your computer. You can choose the model.

6
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:46,300
New in the welcome wizard: pick the colour and the wallpaper. Three wallpapers, Maré, Aurora and Âmbar, and six accent colours, applied immediately system-wide.

7
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:54,100
New: all applications, full screen. It is the first button in the dock and also opens with Super + A. By category, with search.

8
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:01,400
New: English in English sessions. The wizard, DMOS Hub and DMOS IA switch language, for example with “Try DMOS (English)” in the boot menu.

9
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:11,700
Fixes and tests: the menu favourites are now the DMOS ones; some English strings and light-theme buttons were fixed. Tested on VMware Workstation with real clicks and a full install. DMOS IA was tested against a test server; the real Anthropic service has not been tried yet.

10
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:18,000
Download DMOS 1.2: free and open source. sourceforge.net/projects/dmos · dmos.cc
